# Repo-size control: never commit normalized CSVs — the dashboard loader reads the
# parquet twin first (dashboard/data.py load_dataset), so committing the CSV too just
# bloats git history (these are regenerated daily). Keep parquet only.
data/normalized/**/*.csv

